#question(title: [Filling the tank])[
  A tank is being filled with water. At time
  $t$ water flows into the tank at a rate of
  $
    A thin e^(-b t) arctan(c t)
  $
  litres per second, where $A$, $b$, and $c$
  are constants. The amount of water in the
  tank at time $t = 0 s$ is $V_0$. Write an
  expression for the amount of water $V$ in
  the tank at time $t$.
]
